      "english": "Interest declines.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "31387_hikumaru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{年齢|ねんれい}→年齢：01490_nenrei⟧⟦とともに→とともに：30485_totomoni⟧⟦{体力|たいりょく}→体力：05318_tairyoku⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧{低|ひく}まっていく。",
      "english": "Physical strength declines with age.",
