  ],
  "notes": "Mostly abstract subjects: ⟦{関心|かんしん}→関心：00182_kanshin⟧ (interest), ⟦{評価|ひょうか}→評価：03583_hyouka⟧ (reputation), ⟦{危険性|きけんせい}→危険性：17827_kikensei⟧ (risk), ⟦{可能性|かのうせい}→可能性：04818_kanousei⟧ (likelihood). The opposite is ⟦{高|たか}まる→高まる：02066_takamaru⟧ (to rise, to grow).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Intransitive: the thing that falls takes が.\n- Transitive partner: ⟦{低|ひく}める→低める：18732_hikumeru⟧ (to lower something), with ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{低|ひく}く→低い：02947_hikui⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧: to become low — the everyday way to say it\n- ⟦{下|さ}がる→下がる：01188_sagaru⟧: to go down — temperature, prices, grades",
